    "reading": "Two separately named POIs identify the 803 apartment entrance and ICBC at 801 inside the named frozen crescent footprint. The Wikipedia geographic point at 121.461286,31.230652 lies several hundred metres farther southeast on a separate ordinary rectangular building. The Wangjiasha block to the west and Denis Apartments across the road are independent. The source polygon area exceeds the printed 0.59-mu land figure: treat its exact arc and the apartment plan as estimates.",
