  "geometry_scope": "A convex street frontage is tied to the named 1964 polygon and current 801/803 POIs. The municipal plaque fixes completion in 1936. The district gazetteer gives 1934 in a table, and the street gazetteer gives 1935. No original surveyed plan is available. Exact positions of the two entrances, bay spacing, roof columns and service corridor are proportional estimates. Original bank floor and apartment plans are outside the study.",
